#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3062/306203/技能2 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3062/306203/大招.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3062/306203/大招 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3062/306203/入场.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3062/306203/入场 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\"><b>第四幕  夜色笼罩的城堡花园</b><br /><br />月光幽静，女孩儿的头纱如水般闪耀；草地青翠，玫瑰花环的香气在空气中弥漫。<br />“幸福时刻即将来临，爱人的怀抱如此美妙——”<br />是女高音的声音过于曼妙，抑或是神秘术在不知不觉中已控制人心？观众皆痴痴地沉浸在充满爱氛的歌唱中，无人发觉舞台上的苏珊娜已消失不见。<br />与此同时，千里之外的博物馆中，某件被视为稀世珍宝的馆藏也失去了踪影。一场巧妙而怪异的偷窃计划又成功了。<br />这当然是完美的计划——谁都不会发现女主角脖子上的仿冒品，已在悄无声息间被替换成了真品。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"306203\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-306204.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/18/Belonging-306204.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“纯白的艾西”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Ms. Acey in Pure White\"</div></div></div><div>无估值<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>被纯白的厚布料包裹住的艾西老师，小巧精致的外形更适宜当下的着装。这份美丽不仅需要忍耐住聚光灯带来的闷热，还要忍耐住对千篇一律的剧情发表意见的心。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-306205.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/f/fc/Belonging-306205.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">M字型发饰<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">M-shaped Hair Clip</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />35<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>材质为琉璃和铜的发饰，放在手心时会有些许重量感。<br />它在任何一个平凡的饰品店货架上都能被找到，但那些货色并不会在梅兰妮融入大众时提醒她记起伪装成普通人的要领。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-306206.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/e/ef/Belonging-306206.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">红色丝绒手套<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Red Velvet Gloves</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>当服装设计师头疼于如何在装造上保有演员本人的特色时，从艾西老师的口中“不小心”掉出来了这双红色手套。这是能够聚集全场视线的一抹红。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%A4%9C%E6%99%9A%E5%A6%82%E6%AD%A4%E7%A5%A5%E5%92%8C1.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 夜晚如此祥和1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%A4%9C%E6%99%9A%E5%A6%82%E6%AD%A4%E7%A5%A5%E5%92%8C1.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%A4%9C%E6%99%9A%E5%A6%82%E6%AD%A4%E7%A5%A5%E5%92%8C1.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%A4%9C%E6%99%9A%E5%A6%82%E6%AD%A4%E7%A5%A5%E5%92%8C1.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%A4%9C%E6%99%9A%E5%A6%82%E6%AD%A4%E7%A5%A5%E5%92%8C1.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%A4%9C%E6%99%9A%E5%A6%82%E6%AD%A4%E7%A5%A5%E5%92%8C1.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%A4%9C%E6%99%9A%E5%A6%82%E6%AD%A4%E7%A5%A5%E5%92%8C1.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%A4%9C%E6%99%9A%E5%A6%82%E6%AD%A4%E7%A5%A5%E5%92%8C2.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 夜晚如此祥和2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%A4%9C%E6%99%9A%E5%A6%82%E6%AD%A4%E7%A5%A5%E5%92%8C2.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%A4%9C%E6%99%9A%E5%A6%82%E6%AD%A4%E7%A5%A5%E5%92%8C2.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%A4%9C%E6%99%9A%E5%A6%82%E6%AD%A4%E7%A5%A5%E5%92%8C2.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%A4%9C%E6%99%9A%E5%A6%82%E6%AD%A4%E7%A5%A5%E5%92%8C2.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%A4%9C%E6%99%9A%E5%A6%82%E6%AD%A4%E7%A5%A5%E5%92%8C2.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%A4%9C%E6%99%9A%E5%A6%82%E6%AD%A4%E7%A5%A5%E5%92%8C2.jpg 2x\" dat